1                 !Integer, K_Low, Minimum K value
10                !Integer, K_High, Maximum K value
30                !Integer, NumRun, #Replicate Runs per K Value
0                 !Integer, Search by 0/1=Assign_Prob/Relatedness
1                 !Boolean, OutAlleleFre, to output allele frequency (1/0=Y/N)
0                 !Boolean, PopDataQ, PopData available (1/0=Y/N)
0                 !Boolean, PopFlagQ, PopFlag available (1/0=Y/N)
2                 !Integer, Model, 1/2/3/4=Mixture/Admixture/Hybridization/Migration
1                 !Boolean, LocusFst, to estimate locus-specific F-Statistics (1/0=Y/N)
1                 !Boolean, UseKMeans, to Use K-Means clustering Method (1/0=Y/N)
0                 !Boolean, IndivLocQ, Individual location data available (1/0=Y/N)
1                 !Boolean, DataForm, 0/1/2/3/4/5=Indiv data in 1-row/2-rows/1-column/Bytes/.Ped/.Bed
1                 !Boolean, LocusAdmixQ, to compute individual-locus admixture (1/0=Y/N)
1                 !Integer, 0/1/2: Compute relatedness = No/Wang/LynchRitland
1                 !Boolean, KinshipQ, to infer kinship (1/0=Y/N)
